# #5833. A duplicate activation that never claimed appends PreArm after the leaf armed;
# the armed activation's stamped responses do not report foreignHigh, so it advances
# past the duplicate's append.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestDuplicatePreArmUnreported
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a stamped response does not report foreignHigh
PERTURBS: OwnAlloc

--- FIND
    /\ seenU' = [seenU EXCEPT ![a] = Max2(@, lastU)]
    /\ ReportForeign(a)
    /\ UNCHANGED <<durable, acked, floor, leafVars, epochVars, handVars>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ seenU' = [seenU EXCEPT ![a] = Max2(@, lastU)]
\* MUTATION: foreignHigh is not reported.
    /\ UNCHANGED seenP
    /\ UNCHANGED <<durable, acked, floor, leafVars, epochVars, handVars>>
--- END
